# Roaming hunting routes, Teldrassil (Shadowglen). Format and verification: docs/ROAMING.md.
# Points are centres of spawn clusters in the full QuestieDB TBC spawn list; legs were sampled every
# 5 yards against the targets' known spawns.
zone Teldrassil 5091.7x3393.8   # map size in yards: UiMapAssignment uiMap 1438, build 2.5.6.70577

# The Balance of Nature (456): objective 1 Young Nightsabers, objective 2 Young Thistle Boars.
# Both live around the foot of Aldrassil, but on different sides, and a loop through both would
# cross the trunk or leave the glen (rejected: 100 yd from any target spawn). So each objective has
# its own route; the nightsabers come first (objective order), then the boars.

# Young Nightsabers: 25 spawns east and south-east of the tree. The loop stays east of the trunk
# (64 yd or more from Melithar Staghelm at its foot). Worst leg gap 44 yd.
route The Balance of Nature: Young Nightsabers
quest 456
kill 1 2031
radius 20
loop
point 61.6,40.6 | North-east of Aldrassil
point 63.2,42.3 | East edge of the glen
point 62.2,44.4 | South-east
point 60.6,45.6 | South of the tree
end

# Young Thistle Boars: 24 spawns on the west and south-west side. This side is tight: the trunk is to
# the east and the Grellkin camp (hostile, 54.0-54.9) to the west. The points keep 56 yd from the
# trunk's NPCs and 47 yd from the nearest Grellkin spawn, and the order goes around, never across.
# Worst leg gap 37 yd.
route The Balance of Nature: Young Thistle Boars
quest 456
kill 2 1984
radius 15
loop
point 55.8,41.4 | West of the tree, east of the Grellkin
point 56.9,42.6 | Foot of the tree, west side
point 57.3,45.3 | South-west of the tree
point 55.8,43.6 | West side, keep clear of the Grellkin to the west
end
